  "description": {
    "raw": "This spell functions like stinking cloud, except as noted above and that the vapors make creatures sickened instead of nauseated.\n\nCloud of seasickness can be made permanent with a permanency spell (requiring a 9th-level caster and costing 2,500 gp). A permanent cloud of seasickness dispersed by wind reforms in 10 minutes.",
